1
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:07,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

2
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:13,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ABE]
We won something?</b></font>

3
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:16,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, we won something!</b></font>

4
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:19,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You realize that's basically
a participation trophy?</b></font>

5
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:21,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not worth getting
that excited over.</b></font>

6
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:22,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAO]
Oh, shut up, Tonbo.</b></font>

7
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:25,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] A first-year class
has never won an award before!</b></font>

8
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:27,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All thanks to you.</b></font>

9
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:28,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It worked out
'cause you were in charge.</b></font>

10
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:31,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah!
I didn't do that much.</b></font>

11
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:33,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Come on, you can drop
the humble act.</b></font>

12
00:00:33,870 --> 00:00:36,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, this was thanks
to Ishimori's leadership,</b></font>

13
00:00:36,370 --> 00:00:37,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and all your hard work!</b></font>

14
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:39,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ABE] To celebrate,
your favorite teacher's</b></font>

15
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:41,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>gonna take the whole class
out for a meal!</b></font>

16
00:00:41,710 --> 00:00:43,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

17
00:00:43,130 --> 00:00:44,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[YASUSHI] I'm starving!
-[YURU] I promise to study</b></font>

18
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:45,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>extra hard from now on!</b></font>

19
00:00:46,050 --> 00:00:47,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] It went better
than I could've hoped.</b></font>

20
00:00:47,970 --> 00:00:50,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I couldn't have done it without
Miura and everyone else here.</b></font>

21
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:51,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

22
00:00:52,010 --> 00:00:53,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That sure worked out!</b></font>

23
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:55,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ishimori's something else,
for real!</b></font>

24
00:02:26,020 --> 00:02:27,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

25
00:02:28,860 --> 00:02:31,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO] [sighs]
That hit the spot!</b></font>

26
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:33,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI]
Yeah, he picked a good place!</b></font>

27
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:35,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[TAO] I've got a food baby.
-[SHIRAISHI] You're fine.</b></font>

28
00:02:35,860 --> 00:02:38,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-So, anyone wanna go karaoke?
-I do!</b></font>

29
00:02:38,530 --> 00:02:40,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's a place right down
the street we could go to...</b></font>

30
00:02:40,950 --> 00:02:42,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But, uh...</b></font>

31
00:02:42,790 --> 00:02:44,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The 5 o'clock curfew.</b></font>

32
00:02:44,620 --> 00:02:46,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAO] I don't think we can do
anything about that.</b></font>

33
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:47,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI]
She'll get self-conscious</b></font>

34
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:49,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if we all go home.</b></font>

35
00:02:49,210 --> 00:02:51,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI] Yeah,
but this was thanks to her.</b></font>

36
00:02:51,590 --> 00:02:53,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]
Go and enjoy yourselves!</b></font>

37
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:56,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
That was fun, talking to them.</b></font>

38
00:02:56,930 --> 00:02:58,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, it is fun.</b></font>

39
00:03:00,100 --> 00:03:01,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not past-tense.</b></font>

40
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:02,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We'll have more.</b></font>

41
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:04,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

42
00:03:04,430 --> 00:03:05,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

43
00:03:06,060 --> 00:03:07,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Why're you here?</b></font>

44
00:03:07,650 --> 00:03:09,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

45
00:03:09,980 --> 00:03:12,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Social battery's low.</b></font>

46
00:03:12,150 --> 00:03:13,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's walk.</b></font>

47
00:03:13,690 --> 00:03:15,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh...that sounds nice!</b></font>

48
00:03:15,950 --> 00:03:17,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

49
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:20,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We've still got a little time.</b></font>

50
00:03:20,370 --> 00:03:21,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's an arcade.</b></font>

51
00:03:21,950 --> 00:03:23,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Wanna?
-[gasps]</b></font>

52
00:03:24,410 --> 00:03:25,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah!</b></font>

53
00:03:25,620 --> 00:03:28,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Honestly, I've always
wanted to try going to one,</b></font>

54
00:03:28,290 --> 00:03:29,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I never could.</b></font>

55
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:32,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I thought something bad
might happen if I went alone.</b></font>

56
00:03:32,750 --> 00:03:34,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

57
00:03:36,180 --> 00:03:37,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You so crack me up!</b></font>

58
00:03:38,050 --> 00:03:39,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

59
00:03:39,470 --> 00:03:41,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Maybe it's all in my head,</b></font>

60
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:43,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or maybe
I'm getting a big head...</b></font>

61
00:03:44,730 --> 00:03:47,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but, as far as I can tell...</b></font>

62
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:51,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Miura's been changing
bit by bit lately.</b></font>

63
00:03:51,480 --> 00:03:54,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>With life going like this,
I can't wait to see</b></font>

64
00:03:54,610 --> 00:03:56,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>what wonderful things
are ahead!</b></font>

65
00:04:00,530 --> 00:04:02,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

66
00:04:03,990 --> 00:04:06,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You guys hear those
crazy rumors lately?</b></font>

67
00:04:06,540 --> 00:04:07,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is it true?</b></font>

68
00:04:07,870 --> 00:04:10,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did Kanno and Miura
start dating again?</b></font>

69
00:04:10,380 --> 00:04:12,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, that's what I heard.</b></font>

70
00:04:12,290 --> 00:04:13,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 7A]
No surprise there.</b></font>

71
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[SERINA] We're not together!
-[gasps]</b></font>

72
00:04:15,340 --> 00:04:16,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

73
00:04:17,050 --> 00:04:19,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Where'd that come from?
-[laughs]</b></font>

74
00:04:19,640 --> 00:04:21,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At this point,
why not just date him again?</b></font>

75
00:04:22,550 --> 00:04:24,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No way.
I can't.</b></font>

76
00:04:24,180 --> 00:04:25,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 7C]
Hey, Kanno.</b></font>

77
00:04:25,810 --> 00:04:27,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Got a sec?</b></font>

78
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:29,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]
What does she want?</b></font>

79
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll see ya later.</b></font>

80
00:04:31,940 --> 00:04:33,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ohh.</b></font>

81
00:04:33,190 --> 00:04:34,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

82
00:04:34,650 --> 00:04:36,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 7C]
Oguni was going on and on</b></font>

83
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:37,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>about how cute you are.</b></font>

84
00:04:37,820 --> 00:04:40,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But that man is already
property of Asuka.</b></font>

85
00:04:40,450 --> 00:04:43,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At this rate, it sounds like
they'll break up over you.</b></font>

86
00:04:43,450 --> 00:04:44,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What ya gonna do?</b></font>

87
00:04:44,580 --> 00:04:46,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And what do you expect me
to do about it?</b></font>

88
00:04:46,660 --> 00:04:47,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't change what he thinks.</b></font>

89
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE STUDENT 7D]
Not my problem.</b></font>

90
00:04:49,250 --> 00:04:50,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Figure something out.</b></font>

91
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:52,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
Not my problem, either.</b></font>

92
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:55,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[grunts]
-Think I'm joking?</b></font>

93
00:04:55,250 --> 00:04:56,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Serina!</b></font>

94
00:04:56,590 --> 00:04:58,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

95
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:00,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

96
00:05:00,970 --> 00:05:02,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
Kai.</b></font>

97
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hm!</b></font>

98
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:04,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Look at the pretty princess,</b></font>

99
00:05:05,060 --> 00:05:06,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>always getting
rescued by her friends.</b></font>

100
00:05:07,020 --> 00:05:09,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[scoffs] Can't imagine
what that would be like.</b></font>

101
00:05:09,100 --> 00:05:11,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If those two break up,
you better watch out,</b></font>

102
00:05:11,440 --> 00:05:14,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>'cause I can make sure you got
no one left on your side.</b></font>

103
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[growls]</b></font>

104
00:05:15,690 --> 00:05:17,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
Kai, wait!</b></font>

105
00:05:17,110 --> 00:05:18,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm fine, they aren't worth it.</b></font>

106
00:05:18,570 --> 00:05:20,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Just leave 'em.
-You are obviously not fine!</b></font>

107
00:05:20,900 --> 00:05:22,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] I know you!
-[gasps]</b></font>

108
00:05:23,820 --> 00:05:25,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm gonna go talk to Oguni.</b></font>

109
00:05:26,620 --> 00:05:27,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I'll go
let the teacher know</b></font>

110
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>something's wrong!</b></font>

111
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:31,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Of course, they know
things about each other</b></font>

112
00:05:31,330 --> 00:05:32,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that I don't.</b></font>

113
00:05:32,250 --> 00:05:34,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Hey, you okay?
-Yeah.</b></font>

114
00:05:34,130 --> 00:05:36,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-All good.
-What happened there, Serina?</b></font>

115
00:05:36,670 --> 00:05:38,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't worry about
what Kai said.</b></font>

116
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:40,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He just remembered
something from junior high.</b></font>

117
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-[SERINA] Right.</b></font>

118
00:05:42,470 --> 00:05:44,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Keeping it vague
makes people curious.</b></font>

119
00:05:44,850 --> 00:05:46,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm curious too!</b></font>

120
00:05:46,470 --> 00:05:48,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Must've been second year,
I guess?</b></font>

121
00:05:48,430 --> 00:05:50,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wasn't in your class
until third year,</b></font>

122
00:05:50,180 --> 00:05:51,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so I don't know this one.</b></font>

123
00:05:51,980 --> 00:05:53,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll explain.</b></font>

124
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:55,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For as long as I can remember,</b></font>

125
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:56,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was one of the popular kids.</b></font>

126
00:05:57,020 --> 00:05:58,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka and Ayumi groaning]</b></font>

127
00:05:58,190 --> 00:06:01,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry, I swear
it's relevant to the story!</b></font>

128
00:06:01,150 --> 00:06:02,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have always had people
who were on my side.</b></font>

129
00:06:03,450 --> 00:06:04,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

130
00:06:04,530 --> 00:06:06,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then all of that started
crashing down,</b></font>

131
00:06:06,910 --> 00:06:08,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>start of our second year.</b></font>

132
00:06:10,290 --> 00:06:12,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I hear that you've been
texting with Shimizu.</b></font>

133
00:06:12,790 --> 00:06:14,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 7B] Figured you
would know he's dating Hina.</b></font>

134
00:06:14,790 --> 00:06:16,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 7C]
I'm sorry, he didn't tell me</b></font>

135
00:06:16,420 --> 00:06:17,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>anything about that!</b></font>

136
00:06:17,540 --> 00:06:19,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Those girls in our class
kinda scare me.</b></font>

137
00:06:19,710 --> 00:06:21,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Cut it out!
-Hey, wait!</b></font>

138
00:06:21,670 --> 00:06:23,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
She told you she didn't know.</b></font>

139
00:06:23,470 --> 00:06:25,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 7A] So?
It's none of your business.</b></font>

140
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:26,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's none of your
business either,</b></font>

141
00:06:26,970 --> 00:06:27,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but here we are!</b></font>

142
00:06:28,060 --> 00:06:29,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Leave her alone,
before I get mad!</b></font>

143
00:06:29,390 --> 00:06:31,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-Oh?</b></font>

144
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

145
00:06:33,640 --> 00:06:34,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
The hell?</b></font>

146
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:37,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 7D]
You deserve it, for butting in.</b></font>

147
00:06:37,610 --> 00:06:39,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 7E]
Thinks she can do whatever.</b></font>

148
00:06:39,780 --> 00:06:41,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 7F] Popular girl's
gettin' too cocky.</b></font>

149
00:06:41,820 --> 00:06:43,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 7G] I'm sure not
getting in the middle of this.</b></font>

150
00:06:43,860 --> 00:06:45,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 7A]
Girls are scary, dude.</b></font>

151
00:06:45,490 --> 00:06:47,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

152
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
I was alone.</b></font>

153
00:06:49,490 --> 00:06:50,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TEACHER 7A]
Okay, find a partner</b></font>

154
00:06:50,870 --> 00:06:52,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-and check your answers.
-[SERINA] I felt lost.</b></font>

155
00:06:52,450 --> 00:06:53,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Helpless.</b></font>

156
00:06:53,790 --> 00:06:55,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[SERINA] And then?
-[thuds]</b></font>

157
00:06:55,210 --> 00:06:56,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah? Huh?</b></font>

158
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
Why's Miura here?</b></font>

159
00:06:59,670 --> 00:07:00,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What?</b></font>

160
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:02,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We've never spoken
to each other before.</b></font>

161
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kai sighs]</b></font>

162
00:07:04,170 --> 00:07:05,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Serina gasps]</b></font>

163
00:07:05,510 --> 00:07:07,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Come on, give it, Serina.</b></font>

164
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:09,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
We're on first-name basis?</b></font>

165
00:07:09,430 --> 00:07:10,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your handwriting sucks.</b></font>

166
00:07:10,850 --> 00:07:12,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
No one asked you.</b></font>

167
00:07:13,230 --> 00:07:16,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd been scared,
but with him, I was happy.</b></font>

168
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:18,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

169
00:07:18,900 --> 00:07:21,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kai's got an aura
no one wants to mess with,</b></font>

170
00:07:21,610 --> 00:07:24,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>which means no one wanted
to mess with me after that.</b></font>

171
00:07:24,110 --> 00:07:26,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

172
00:07:26,700 --> 00:07:28,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[SERINA] Need some help?
-[gasps]</b></font>

173
00:07:28,450 --> 00:07:30,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, I'm okay.</b></font>

174
00:07:31,030 --> 00:07:33,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[sighs]
-You're a real nice person.</b></font>

175
00:07:33,790 --> 00:07:35,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's not a compliment.</b></font>

176
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

177
00:07:37,370 --> 00:07:39,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know, if the shoe
were on the other foot,</b></font>

178
00:07:39,460 --> 00:07:41,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I might've done
the exact same thing.</b></font>

179
00:07:41,750 --> 00:07:43,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This only happened
because you're not like her.</b></font>

180
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:44,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

181
00:07:45,880 --> 00:07:47,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[SERINA] Is that?
-A compliment.</b></font>

182
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:48,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

183
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

184
00:07:50,260 --> 00:07:51,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then, thanks.</b></font>

185
00:07:52,930 --> 00:07:54,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 7H]
Break's coming up.</b></font>

186
00:07:54,100 --> 00:07:56,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We should do something
together as a class!</b></font>

187
00:07:56,190 --> 00:07:58,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For sure!
You in, Kai?</b></font>

188
00:07:58,270 --> 00:08:00,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll pass.
Not really my thing.</b></font>

189
00:08:00,610 --> 00:08:01,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 7H]
Aww.</b></font>

190
00:08:01,690 --> 00:08:03,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 7B]
C'mon, man, that's cold.</b></font>

191
00:08:03,860 --> 00:08:06,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

192
00:08:06,110 --> 00:08:07,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
You should go and have fun.</b></font>

193
00:08:08,320 --> 00:08:10,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like I said, can't help
if it's not my thing.</b></font>

194
00:08:10,990 --> 00:08:12,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

195
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:13,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
I thought he only said that</b></font>

196
00:08:13,330 --> 00:08:15,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to make me feel better.</b></font>

197
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:16,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I got the wrong idea.</b></font>

198
00:08:16,750 --> 00:08:20,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But even if it was,
I wouldn't leave you behind.</b></font>

199
00:08:20,420 --> 00:08:21,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

200
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:24,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

201
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:26,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
Ah, sorry.</b></font>

202
00:08:26,170 --> 00:08:27,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That was really sweet.</b></font>

203
00:08:28,300 --> 00:08:29,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

204
00:08:29,760 --> 00:08:31,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[wind whooshing]</b></font>

205
00:08:31,140 --> 00:08:33,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

206
00:08:34,390 --> 00:08:35,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm fine.</b></font>

207
00:08:36,020 --> 00:08:37,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Forever.</b></font>

208
00:08:37,850 --> 00:08:39,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As long as I have Kai.</b></font>

209
00:08:42,150 --> 00:08:43,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE TEACHER 7A]
Miura!</b></font>

210
00:08:43,520 --> 00:08:44,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's missing today?</b></font>

211
00:08:44,940 --> 00:08:46,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not like him.</b></font>

212
00:08:46,190 --> 00:08:48,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 7I] What'll she do
without her white knight</b></font>

213
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to save her?</b></font>

214
00:08:50,030 --> 00:08:52,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're less than shit
without him.</b></font>

215
00:08:52,530 --> 00:08:54,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

216
00:08:54,490 --> 00:08:57,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

217
00:08:59,830 --> 00:09:01,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

218
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:03,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
My B. Overslept.</b></font>

219
00:09:03,670 --> 00:09:05,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
I was dependent on him.</b></font>

220
00:09:06,760 --> 00:09:08,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't realize it until then,</b></font>

221
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:10,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I had become weak.</b></font>

222
00:09:11,130 --> 00:09:13,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[crying]</b></font>

223
00:09:14,510 --> 00:09:16,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>To Kai, it probably seemed like</b></font>

224
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:18,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was terrified
of being left alone.</b></font>

225
00:09:19,430 --> 00:09:21,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I made him work way too hard.</b></font>

226
00:09:21,850 --> 00:09:22,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka sighs]</b></font>

227
00:09:22,940 --> 00:09:23,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But it's fine!</b></font>

228
00:09:24,020 --> 00:09:25,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm a whole different
person nowadays.</b></font>

229
00:09:26,860 --> 00:09:28,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, why'd you two
call it quits?</b></font>

230
00:09:28,650 --> 00:09:30,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Serina groans]</b></font>

231
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:32,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because I legitimately sucked.</b></font>

232
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:33,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 7J] The only reason
a boy like Miura</b></font>

233
00:09:33,820 --> 00:09:34,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>would go out with you
is because</b></font>

234
00:09:34,950 --> 00:09:36,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he feels sorry for you.</b></font>

235
00:09:36,700 --> 00:09:38,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
It's not like I believed her.</b></font>

236
00:09:39,540 --> 00:09:42,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But sometimes,
it's pretty much impossible</b></font>

237
00:09:42,370 --> 00:09:44,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to tell what's going on
in that head of his.</b></font>

238
00:09:47,670 --> 00:09:49,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kai, I need you.</b></font>

239
00:09:50,630 --> 00:09:53,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But...you don't need me.</b></font>

240
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:57,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It hurts.</b></font>

241
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:01,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't recall.
Why did I do...</b></font>

242
00:10:02,940 --> 00:10:04,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, sorry.</b></font>

243
00:10:04,190 --> 00:10:06,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, then,
do you hate me now, Uka?</b></font>

244
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:09,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

245
00:10:09,610 --> 00:10:11,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA] [chuckles]
Thank goodness.</b></font>

246
00:10:12,950 --> 00:10:13,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

247
00:10:14,030 --> 00:10:16,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] A lot of things
are starting to make sense.</b></font>

248
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:18,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Up to now,</b></font>

249
00:10:18,740 --> 00:10:20,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was having
too much fun to realize.</b></font>

250
00:10:21,910 --> 00:10:23,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Serina?</b></font>

251
00:10:23,370 --> 00:10:25,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>May I ask you
something personal?</b></font>

252
00:10:26,590 --> 00:10:28,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Be honest.</b></font>

253
00:10:28,460 --> 00:10:30,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you still have
feelings for Miura?</b></font>

254
00:10:30,380 --> 00:10:32,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

255
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:34,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

256
00:10:34,550 --> 00:10:36,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course not.
We're through.</b></font>

257
00:10:36,970 --> 00:10:38,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

258
00:10:41,770 --> 00:10:43,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're a bad liar, Serina.</b></font>

259
00:10:43,690 --> 00:10:44,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's okay.</b></font>

260
00:10:45,690 --> 00:10:47,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh!</b></font>

261
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:49,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE TEACHER 7A] Kanno!
Thank goodness you're safe!</b></font>

262
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:51,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Are you hurt?
-[SERINA] Not at all.</b></font>

263
00:10:51,190 --> 00:10:52,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE TEACHER 7A]
Good.</b></font>

264
00:10:52,400 --> 00:10:53,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can rest assured
knowing the faculty</b></font>

265
00:10:53,990 --> 00:10:55,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>takes this seriously.</b></font>

266
00:10:55,860 --> 00:10:58,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA] Yes.
Thank you, sir.</b></font>

267
00:10:58,240 --> 00:10:59,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's great.</b></font>

268
00:10:59,370 --> 00:11:01,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sounds like everything's
gonna work out for you!</b></font>

269
00:11:01,580 --> 00:11:04,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The teachers have your back,
and you've always got Miura.</b></font>

270
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:05,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

271
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, whatever you think
is happening,</b></font>

272
00:11:07,420 --> 00:11:08,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you've got it wrong!</b></font>

273
00:11:08,670 --> 00:11:09,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sorry.</b></font>

274
00:11:09,920 --> 00:11:12,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't...
What should I do here?</b></font>

275
00:11:12,460 --> 00:11:14,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I mean, you like Kai too, so...</b></font>

276
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:16,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

277
00:11:18,220 --> 00:11:19,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're done.</b></font>

278
00:11:19,300 --> 00:11:21,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not his girlfriend anymore.</b></font>

279
00:11:21,180 --> 00:11:23,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-So, you--
-[UKA] I like him.</b></font>

280
00:11:23,640 --> 00:11:25,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] But only in a respectful,
platonic way.</b></font>

281
00:11:26,810 --> 00:11:29,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's special to me,
but not like that.</b></font>

282
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:30,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Promise.</b></font>

283
00:11:30,650 --> 00:11:32,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's nothing
romantic going on.</b></font>

284
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:33,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah?</b></font>

285
00:11:35,070 --> 00:11:36,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Ayumi sighs]</b></font>

286
00:11:38,280 --> 00:11:39,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Let's go.</b></font>

287
00:11:43,450 --> 00:11:44,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

288
00:11:44,580 --> 00:11:45,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'll be okay.</b></font>

289
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:48,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't want her walking
on eggshells around me.</b></font>

290
00:11:49,420 --> 00:11:50,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course, not.</b></font>

291
00:11:50,920 --> 00:11:52,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're through.</b></font>

292
00:11:52,300 --> 00:11:53,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You like Kai too, so...</b></font>

293
00:11:55,170 --> 00:11:57,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU] Heard you got
into a fight with Oguni.</b></font>

294
00:11:57,300 --> 00:11:58,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
It wasn't a fight.</b></font>

295
00:11:58,510 --> 00:11:59,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, right, dude.</b></font>

296
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:01,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I saw you yelling
at each other.</b></font>

297
00:12:01,430 --> 00:12:02,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, what happened?</b></font>

298
00:12:03,020 --> 00:12:04,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You are obviously not fine!</b></font>

299
00:12:04,770 --> 00:12:05,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I know you!</b></font>

300
00:12:06,020 --> 00:12:07,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Serina's still
in love with Miura.</b></font>

301
00:12:08,810 --> 00:12:10,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And he must feel the same.</b></font>

302
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:14,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Call me for help next time.</b></font>

303
00:12:14,230 --> 00:12:15,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Serina.</b></font>

304
00:12:16,740 --> 00:12:18,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

305
00:12:18,450 --> 00:12:21,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
They'll be fine without me.</b></font>

306
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

307
00:12:27,870 --> 00:12:30,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI]
Yeah! Summer break, baby!</b></font>

308
00:12:30,630 --> 00:12:31,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I'm so stoked!
-We should hang out!</b></font>

309
00:12:31,790 --> 00:12:32,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can finally sleep in!</b></font>

310
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:34,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think we should meet up
at the summer festival,</b></font>

311
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:36,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if anyone's planning to go!</b></font>

312
00:12:36,470 --> 00:12:38,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ABE]
Just make sure you come back!</b></font>

313
00:12:38,340 --> 00:12:40,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Lots of kids drop out
after a long break.</b></font>

314
00:12:40,760 --> 00:12:41,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO]
You in, Kai?</b></font>

315
00:12:42,050 --> 00:12:43,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

316
00:12:43,430 --> 00:12:45,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He can't go anywhere
without Ishimori!</b></font>

317
00:12:45,680 --> 00:12:47,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The two of them
are attached at the hip!</b></font>

318
00:12:47,770 --> 00:12:49,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kinda figured
that'd be out the window</b></font>

319
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:50,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when the school year's over.</b></font>

320
00:12:50,900 --> 00:12:52,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>'Cause why would
they bother hanging out</b></font>

321
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:53,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when we're on break?</b></font>

322
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:54,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You got a point there.</b></font>

323
00:12:54,780 --> 00:12:57,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I didn't have to butt in
to correct them this time.</b></font>

324
00:12:58,110 --> 00:13:00,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, you'll be hanging out
with Kanno, I guess?</b></font>

325
00:13:01,070 --> 00:13:02,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Never said a thing about that.</b></font>

326
00:13:02,740 --> 00:13:04,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[TONBO] You got it good, man.
-[KAI] What does that mean?</b></font>

327
00:13:04,700 --> 00:13:05,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Of course.</b></font>

328
00:13:05,790 --> 00:13:08,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If they're hanging out,
I need to make myself scarce.</b></font>

329
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Goodbye, Miura.</b></font>

330
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:11,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll see you next term.</b></font>

331
00:13:11,750 --> 00:13:12,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kai sighs]</b></font>

332
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:14,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I refuse to get in their way.</b></font>

333
00:13:14,500 --> 00:13:15,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

334
00:13:15,630 --> 00:13:17,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[insects chirping]</b></font>

335
00:13:19,970 --> 00:13:21,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

336
00:13:24,100 --> 00:13:25,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
It's sad.</b></font>

337
00:13:25,180 --> 00:13:27,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I heard people say
you shouldn't fall for him,</b></font>

338
00:13:27,430 --> 00:13:28,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I did anyway.</b></font>

339
00:13:28,770 --> 00:13:30,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

340
00:13:30,940 --> 00:13:33,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was excited to belong.
To grow up.</b></font>

341
00:13:33,900 --> 00:13:36,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But that line of thinking
was way too selfish.</b></font>

342
00:13:37,280 --> 00:13:38,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What about Serina?</b></font>

343
00:13:39,030 --> 00:13:40,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How much have I hurt her?</b></font>

344
00:13:41,450 --> 00:13:43,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

345
00:13:43,950 --> 00:13:45,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

346
00:13:47,580 --> 00:13:48,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Today's the summer festival.</b></font>

347
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I bet...</b></font>

348
00:13:51,540 --> 00:13:52,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they look great together.</b></font>

349
00:13:55,500 --> 00:13:57,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wanna see.</b></font>

350
00:13:57,630 --> 00:13:59,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sort of.</b></font>

351
00:13:59,130 --> 00:14:00,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I could never un-see them,</b></font>

352
00:14:01,050 --> 00:14:03,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and it would break my heart.</b></font>

353
00:14:03,090 --> 00:14:04,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

354
00:14:04,180 --> 00:14:06,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door bell ringing]</b></font>

355
00:14:06,100 --> 00:14:07,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Coming!</b></font>

356
00:14:07,560 --> 00:14:09,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh!</b></font>

357
00:14:09,350 --> 00:14:10,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?
[trembling]</b></font>

358
00:14:12,190 --> 00:14:13,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why're you here?</b></font>

359
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:15,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For you, if you're
not already busy!</b></font>

360
00:14:15,650 --> 00:14:17,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm going to the festival.</b></font>

361
00:14:17,440 --> 00:14:18,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] By myself.
-[chuckles]</b></font>

362
00:14:18,530 --> 00:14:19,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I came over
'cause I wanted to ask</b></font>

363
00:14:19,740 --> 00:14:21,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if you wanted to go with me!</b></font>

364
00:14:22,450 --> 00:14:23,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both giggle]</b></font>

365
00:14:23,910 --> 00:14:24,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah!</b></font>

366
00:14:25,990 --> 00:14:27,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I've only been
to festivals with my parents!</b></font>

367
00:14:27,950 --> 00:14:28,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
No way!</b></font>

368
00:14:29,040 --> 00:14:30,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You mean,
I get to be your first?</b></font>

369
00:14:31,250 --> 00:14:32,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

370
00:14:34,210 --> 00:14:35,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

371
00:14:39,670 --> 00:14:40,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[trembling]</b></font>

372
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:43,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Should we grab a bite
or play a game first?</b></font>

373
00:14:43,970 --> 00:14:45,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Uh, I don't--</b></font>

374
00:14:45,510 --> 00:14:47,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What do ya say
we try scoping it out?</b></font>

375
00:14:47,510 --> 00:14:49,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-C'mon!
-Ah?</b></font>

376
00:14:49,100 --> 00:14:51,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] Hold on!
-Yeah? Something wrong?</b></font>

377
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:53,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What time did you tell Seto
you're meeting up?</b></font>

378
00:14:53,850 --> 00:14:55,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
What do you mean?</b></font>

379
00:14:55,480 --> 00:14:58,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-We're not meeting up.
-[gasps]</b></font>

380
00:14:58,150 --> 00:14:59,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Why not?</b></font>

381
00:14:59,230 --> 00:15:00,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's just you and me today!</b></font>

382
00:15:01,070 --> 00:15:03,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We can't talk girl stuff
with a boy around.</b></font>

383
00:15:03,900 --> 00:15:05,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And no judgment.</b></font>

384
00:15:05,610 --> 00:15:06,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not about to tell you</b></font>

385
00:15:06,820 --> 00:15:08,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you've gotta confess
to Kai straight away.</b></font>

386
00:15:08,910 --> 00:15:11,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I feel like you're not
in the right headspace.</b></font>

387
00:15:11,290 --> 00:15:13,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But please tell me if things
are getting too hard!</b></font>

388
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:16,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[AYUMI] So?
-[UKA] She's the best.</b></font>

389
00:15:16,380 --> 00:15:18,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I'm sure she was hoping
to come here with Seto,</b></font>

390
00:15:19,040 --> 00:15:20,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but she was worried about me.</b></font>

391
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:23,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 7B]
Whoa, what a babe!</b></font>

392
00:15:23,170 --> 00:15:24,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 7C]
Is she famous?</b></font>

393
00:15:24,380 --> 00:15:26,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wow, I've seen that girl
around here before.</b></font>

394
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:27,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's Serina from Hachimitsu!</b></font>

395
00:15:27,800 --> 00:15:29,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Glad you were able
to make it out here.</b></font>

396
00:15:29,430 --> 00:15:32,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Wait, why isn't Miura with her?</b></font>

397
00:15:32,180 --> 00:15:35,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Hey, where's Miura?
-Dunno. Sure he's fine.</b></font>

398
00:15:35,230 --> 00:15:36,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hold up!</b></font>

399
00:15:36,230 --> 00:15:37,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You mean you don't have
plans with him?</b></font>

400
00:15:37,770 --> 00:15:38,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now there's a laugh.</b></font>

401
00:15:38,980 --> 00:15:40,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kai doesn't wanna
be here with me.</b></font>

402
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:43,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MIHO] Why not?
-Well, why do ya think?</b></font>

403
00:15:43,530 --> 00:15:45,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's probably off
somewhere with Uka.</b></font>

404
00:15:45,610 --> 00:15:47,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIHO]
Ishimori? No way!</b></font>

405
00:15:47,740 --> 00:15:49,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
It's okay, let it go, Miho.</b></font>

406
00:15:49,160 --> 00:15:50,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Serina.</b></font>

407
00:15:51,410 --> 00:15:54,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This only happened because
I said Miura was special to me.</b></font>

408
00:15:54,580 --> 00:15:55,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What should I do now?</b></font>

409
00:15:57,170 --> 00:15:58,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, Uka!</b></font>

410
00:15:58,250 --> 00:16:00,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I bought us some cotton candy!</b></font>

411
00:16:00,090 --> 00:16:02,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You in?
Can't do it alone!</b></font>

412
00:16:02,130 --> 00:16:03,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, I'd love one!</b></font>

413
00:16:03,260 --> 00:16:04,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[SATORU] Found you!
-Huh?</b></font>

414
00:16:04,970 --> 00:16:05,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ayumi!</b></font>

415
00:16:06,050 --> 00:16:07,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[laughs]
-[gasps]</b></font>

416
00:16:07,550 --> 00:16:08,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've been lookin'
all over for you!</b></font>

417
00:16:08,890 --> 00:16:09,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I told you!</b></font>

418
00:16:10,010 --> 00:16:13,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uka and I need time without
anyone else around, okay?</b></font>

419
00:16:13,220 --> 00:16:14,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, I'll join you!</b></font>

420
00:16:14,310 --> 00:16:15,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why can't I tag along, huh?</b></font>

421
00:16:15,430 --> 00:16:16,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Read the room, dude!</b></font>

422
00:16:17,060 --> 00:16:18,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry, Uka!
Gimme a sec.</b></font>

423
00:16:18,440 --> 00:16:19,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll be back
after I tell him off!</b></font>

424
00:16:19,980 --> 00:16:21,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Satoru.
Come on.</b></font>

425
00:16:21,400 --> 00:16:22,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now, this way!</b></font>

426
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:23,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
Ooh, Cotton Candy!</b></font>

427
00:16:23,690 --> 00:16:24,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[SATORU] Can I have some?
-[AYUMI] Get a grip!</b></font>

428
00:16:24,780 --> 00:16:25,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] Can you not chill out
for one minute?</b></font>

429
00:16:26,030 --> 00:16:27,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
Uh-uh!</b></font>

430
00:16:27,610 --> 00:16:29,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

431
00:16:29,490 --> 00:16:31,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

432
00:16:36,460 --> 00:16:38,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I should leave.</b></font>

433
00:16:38,250 --> 00:16:39,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm a third wheel.</b></font>

434
00:16:39,580 --> 00:16:41,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

435
00:16:41,590 --> 00:16:44,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This world is full
of incredible people.</b></font>

436
00:16:44,250 --> 00:16:45,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>People worth admiring.</b></font>

437
00:16:46,380 --> 00:16:48,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>People who will forever
be out of my reach.</b></font>

438
00:16:50,470 --> 00:16:53,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can appreciate their beauty,
but that's all.</b></font>

439
00:16:55,220 --> 00:16:57,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If I stay away,</b></font>

440
00:16:57,100 --> 00:16:59,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>at least I won't hurt
anyone else.</b></font>

441
00:16:59,100 --> 00:17:01,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

442
00:17:02,560 --> 00:17:03,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] Ishimori!
-[gasps]</b></font>

443
00:17:03,940 --> 00:17:05,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

444
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Miura, you're here?</b></font>

445
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:13,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You should be...</b></font>

446
00:17:13,740 --> 00:17:15,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

447
00:17:16,370 --> 00:17:18,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[sighs]
-Huh?</b></font>

448
00:17:20,620 --> 00:17:21,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Hey!</b></font>

449
00:17:21,790 --> 00:17:23,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka breathing heavily]</b></font>

450
00:17:23,500 --> 00:17:24,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Please slow down!</b></font>

451
00:17:27,130 --> 00:17:28,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Come on, stop!</b></font>

452
00:17:31,430 --> 00:17:33,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Finally caught you.</b></font>

453
00:17:33,140 --> 00:17:34,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why did you run away?</b></font>

454
00:17:35,970 --> 00:17:37,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sniffles]</b></font>

455
00:17:38,810 --> 00:17:39,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

456
00:17:41,600 --> 00:17:42,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're crying.</b></font>

457
00:17:43,730 --> 00:17:44,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is something wrong?</b></font>

458
00:17:47,860 --> 00:17:50,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They, they're tears
of happiness.</b></font>

459
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:52,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you happen to see them,</b></font>

460
00:17:52,660 --> 00:17:54,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>tell Ayumi and Satoru
I said thanks.</b></font>

461
00:17:54,700 --> 00:17:56,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

462
00:18:00,580 --> 00:18:01,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Going home?</b></font>

463
00:18:02,670 --> 00:18:03,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll take you.</b></font>

464
00:18:07,170 --> 00:18:09,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
No, it's okay.</b></font>

465
00:18:09,590 --> 00:18:12,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please let go.
I'm fine.</b></font>

466
00:18:12,180 --> 00:18:14,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Shake me off if you want.</b></font>

467
00:18:14,090 --> 00:18:15,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

468
00:18:15,890 --> 00:18:17,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd rather walk alone
right now.</b></font>

469
00:18:20,020 --> 00:18:21,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're a bad liar, Ishimori.</b></font>

470
00:18:22,060 --> 00:18:23,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

471
00:18:23,690 --> 00:18:25,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] You've got
a cell phone, don't you?</b></font>

472
00:18:26,770 --> 00:18:28,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.
At home.</b></font>

473
00:18:28,780 --> 00:18:30,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That kinda defeats the purpose.</b></font>

474
00:18:30,860 --> 00:18:32,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How am I supposed
to contact you</b></font>

475
00:18:32,200 --> 00:18:33,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>over summer break?</b></font>

476
00:18:34,450 --> 00:18:36,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And-And why'd you say,
"See you next term?"</b></font>

477
00:18:36,830 --> 00:18:38,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You didn't plan
to see me at all?</b></font>

478
00:18:39,370 --> 00:18:40,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I went to invite you today,</b></font>

479
00:18:40,450 --> 00:18:42,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but Ayumi beat me to the punch.</b></font>

480
00:18:43,290 --> 00:18:44,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
But why?</b></font>

481
00:18:44,790 --> 00:18:46,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
So?</b></font>

482
00:18:46,500 --> 00:18:47,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You don't wanna hold my hand?</b></font>

483
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:49,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

484
00:18:49,800 --> 00:18:51,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Feel free to shake me off.</b></font>

485
00:18:51,470 --> 00:18:52,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

486
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:56,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
See?</b></font>

487
00:18:56,350 --> 00:18:57,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, can I walk you?</b></font>

488
00:19:00,310 --> 00:19:02,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
No, I can't do it.</b></font>

489
00:19:02,310 --> 00:19:03,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

490
00:19:05,810 --> 00:19:07,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have to go find Serina.</b></font>

491
00:19:07,230 --> 00:19:09,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

492
00:19:09,780 --> 00:19:11,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sorry!</b></font>

493
00:19:11,360 --> 00:19:13,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

494
00:19:15,280 --> 00:19:16,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I can't.</b></font>

495
00:19:16,740 --> 00:19:18,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't give him up like that!</b></font>

496
00:19:20,370 --> 00:19:22,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
You're a bad liar.</b></font>

497
00:19:22,620 --> 00:19:24,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
She realized it.</b></font>

498
00:19:24,210 --> 00:19:25,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Serina must've known I lied!</b></font>

499
00:19:26,830 --> 00:19:28,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm hopeless.</b></font>

500
00:19:28,340 --> 00:19:30,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At this point, I'm in too deep!</b></font>

501
00:19:30,670 --> 00:19:32,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

502
00:19:32,420 --> 00:19:34,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But please tell me if things
are getting too hard!</b></font>

503
00:19:34,550 --> 00:19:36,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

504
00:19:36,840 --> 00:19:37,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Because...</b></font>

505
00:19:37,930 --> 00:19:39,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, why do ya think?</b></font>

506
00:19:39,260 --> 00:19:41,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's probably off
somewhere with Uka.</b></font>

507
00:19:42,020 --> 00:19:45,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] If my friends have
already figured out how I feel,</b></font>

508
00:19:45,100 --> 00:19:46,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they won't be able
to brush it off!</b></font>

509
00:19:46,810 --> 00:19:48,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Apologies!
Excuse me!</b></font>

510
00:19:48,860 --> 00:19:50,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

511
00:19:52,900 --> 00:19:54,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There you are!</b></font>

512
00:19:54,190 --> 00:19:55,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Didn't expect that from you!</b></font>

513
00:19:55,650 --> 00:19:57,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sorry
for ditching you, Ayumi.</b></font>

514
00:19:58,240 --> 00:20:01,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Serina!
-Yeah? What's up?</b></font>

515
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:02,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was lying.</b></font>

516
00:20:02,580 --> 00:20:04,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Honestly...I...</b></font>

517
00:20:06,500 --> 00:20:08,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I am in love with him!</b></font>

518
00:20:08,960 --> 00:20:10,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

519
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:13,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm... I'm sorry
for what I said before.</b></font>

520
00:20:14,550 --> 00:20:16,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sorry my words
made you suffer more.</b></font>

521
00:20:17,760 --> 00:20:20,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But it is true, and I won't
hide those feelings from you.</b></font>

522
00:20:20,890 --> 00:20:22,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

523
00:20:23,600 --> 00:20:24,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

524
00:20:24,770 --> 00:20:27,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm so glad that
you could tell me, Uka.</b></font>

525
00:20:27,140 --> 00:20:28,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

526
00:20:28,810 --> 00:20:30,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was wondering what I did
to make you lie to me.</b></font>

527
00:20:31,820 --> 00:20:33,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I guess
I'm guilty of that, too.</b></font>

528
00:20:34,650 --> 00:20:35,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

529
00:20:35,740 --> 00:20:38,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You and I must have
something wrong with us.</b></font>

530
00:20:38,160 --> 00:20:39,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Promise.</b></font>

531
00:20:39,280 --> 00:20:41,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I won't hold back with you.</b></font>

532
00:20:41,160 --> 00:20:42,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, you'd better do the same.</b></font>

533
00:20:43,450 --> 00:20:45,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Be loud and proud!</b></font>

534
00:20:45,120 --> 00:20:46,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Both of us love Kai!</b></font>

535
00:20:46,750 --> 00:20:48,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

536
00:20:51,170 --> 00:20:52,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[fireworks bursting]</b></font>

537
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:54,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[crying]</b></font>

538
00:20:56,170 --> 00:20:57,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
If I hadn't shown up,</b></font>

539
00:20:58,050 --> 00:21:00,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they would've
worked out perfectly.</b></font>

540
00:21:00,260 --> 00:21:01,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sobbing]</b></font>

541
00:21:01,890 --> 00:21:03,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm so glad!</b></font>

542
00:21:04,470 --> 00:21:05,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Jeez, I was so worried</b></font>

543
00:21:05,890 --> 00:21:07,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that you two were
gonna bottle it up...</b></font>

544
00:21:07,600 --> 00:21:10,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Even if I tried,
I couldn't stop.</b></font>

545
00:21:10,350 --> 00:21:12,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sorry, but I love him.</b></font>

546
00:21:12,360 --> 00:21:14,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
But you both said it!</b></font>

547
00:21:14,650 --> 00:21:16,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sobbing]
[fireworks bursting]</b></font>

